<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<div type="jAn">       <head><hi rendition="#c"><figure/>Für Leidende!<figure/></hi></head><lb/>
<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<p>Damit jeder Kranke, bevor er eine Kur unter-<lb/>
